{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the rogue-lite game <strong>Crispy Kart</strong>, you play as a cookie dreaming of becoming a pro racer. To join the racing league, you must gather experience, collect materials, and defeat the shadowy saboteur disrupting the races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your kart and collected weapons to crush waves of enemy motorized vehicles and mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/0b4c62cb06e112c4bf334d2b4b976bec.poster.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/0b4c62cb06e112c4bf334d2b4b976bec.webm?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/0b4c62cb06e112c4bf334d2b4b976bec.mp4?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ram, shoot, bomb, loot, upgrade! This is your core combat loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just remember\u2014your battle kart is made entirely of\u2026 desserts and baked goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/ee2c2333b4388ea56f53bc5879f13e40.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/b9017c4c06304d339a60c769adc2ecf4.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique weapons and items</strong> to choose from (Lollipop Wrecking Ball, Popcorn Shotgun, and more).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/8332659586458a87c98ae14d71fd731f.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both you and enemy vehicles have drivers who escape when their vehicles are destroyed. Eliminate enemy drivers for bonus materials. If your own driver escapes... RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit eccentric cookie co-pilots: Normally helpful allies, but... you'll never predict their next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/02640e675299ce859c13b2c05022f3a2.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/014f144f5cdc34f71a967147b9848ce9.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through block walls! All walls are edible and destructible. Destroying them often drops crucial materials for permanent progression. You can also dash through them invincibly - though save your dash for combat emergencies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random power-up panels appear on roads. Drive over them for temporary boosts to dominate battles - your key to reversing tough situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/fa86b6067f7ec7b54961ad21a5abfc57.poster.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/fa86b6067f7ec7b54961ad21a5abfc57.webm?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/fa86b6067f7ec7b54961ad21a5abfc57.mp4?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/16cb27b267c1ec45025dd4048ec5a955.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite mechanics let you collect materials/currency during runs to permanently upgrade your kart for previously impossible challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-enhance your kart through weapon/equipment synergies. Transform it into an indestructible mobile fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/8b9eb87e1a6ef17a198808c7c9fc279d.avif?t=1756712215\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/9bc832c9209e2152b3098166142127c7.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev up your customized kart...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/3e3389736f5f5ce7616926b24247f9e6.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=282 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627650?t=1756712215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/647388a5d68ec12e3a428b0d252995d19f83d13d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756712215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/2d5218d884372d96c25c64500cf9fd9ffa78bcbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756712215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/2d5218d884372d96c25c64500cf9fd9ffa78bcbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756712215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3833060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the rogue-lite game <strong>Crispy Kart</strong>, you play as a cookie dreaming of becoming a pro racer. To join the racing league, you must gather experience, collect materials, and defeat the shadowy saboteur disrupting the races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your kart and collected weapons to crush waves of enemy motorized vehicles and mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/0b4c62cb06e112c4bf334d2b4b976bec.poster.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/0b4c62cb06e112c4bf334d2b4b976bec.webm?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/0b4c62cb06e112c4bf334d2b4b976bec.mp4?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ram, shoot, bomb, loot, upgrade! This is your core combat loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just remember\u2014your battle kart is made entirely of\u2026 desserts and baked goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam