nate battles - your key to reversing tough situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/fa86b6067f7ec7b54961ad21a5abfc57.poster.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/fa86b6067f7ec7b54961ad21a5abfc57.webm?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/fa86b6067f7ec7b54961ad21a5abfc57.mp4?t=1756712215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/16cb27b267c1ec45025dd4048ec5a955.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite mechanics let you collect materials/currency during runs to permanently upgrade your kart for previously impossible challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-enhance your kart through weapon/equipment synergies. Transform it into an indestructible mobile fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/8b9eb87e1a6ef17a198808c7c9fc279d.avif?t=1756712215\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/9bc832c9209e2152b3098166142127c7.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev up your customized kart...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/extras/3e3389736f5f5ce7616926b24247f9e6.avif?t=1756712215\" width=616 height=282 /></span></p>","developers":["LemonBow Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627650/06d90c097b4b5b08ac8a4a3673f5d44194064c49/header.jpg?t=1756712215","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139289,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139289/movie480.mp4?t=1747408257","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139289/movie_max.mp4?t=1747408257"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139289/9dd688dad7e702fb78bc89a27c5e7e9b73775b7e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747408257","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139289/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747408257","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139289/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747408257"}}],"name":"Crispy Kart","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256MB, OpenGL 3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["LemonBow Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.