t=1756712215"}],"short_description":"Crispy Kart is a pixel-style survivor-like game where players take the wheel of a kart made of cookies and desserts, battling through waves of enemy vehicles to survive\u2014all while uncovering the sinister group sabotaging the races.","steam_appid":3627650,"support_info":{"email":"smallujk@foxmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}